WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.261
Do you want to go to the cinema on Saturday?

00:00:02.511 --> 00:00:05.399
Yes, but I work until six.

00:00:05.649 --> 00:00:07.814
We can go after dinner.

00:00:08.064 --> 00:00:11.030
Good idea. Shall we meet at eight?

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:13.542
All right, in front of the cinema.
